// ====

// A result-bearing function may have a direct body path that source control
// proves cannot reach its ordinary return. The undefined path uses the common
// epilogue without fabricating a result value.
// RUN: emit x86-native-bytes @unreachable_tail
x86.target<scalar> @target

low.func.def target<x86.scalar.core>(@target) @unreachable_tail() -> (reg<x86.gpr32>) asm {
  low.unreachable
}

